Description: desktop admin and library manager for the playstick appliance
 Prepares films for the playstick media player -- probing, encoding the
 headphone audio, fetching metadata and posters -- copies them onto the
 share the stick reads, and tells the stick what is there.
 .
 Runs on the machine that encodes the library, not on the stick. The
 Config tab edits a playstick checkout's Ansible variables and runs its
 actl, so it needs a clone of the repo named in Settings.
